{"asset_key":"timeline/dialoguetree_story_10110940","episode":"timeline","category":"dialoguetree_story","story_id":"10110940","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"narration:1:1010523054:0":{"text":"그리고...","source_cn":"与此同时……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1EAADDDF95DA0D6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091001:":{"text":"이 사람이 이번 책임자인가요? 당신들이 구해준 모양이군.","source_cn":"他就是这次的负责人吗？被你们救出来了啊","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x724832CD36AAE3FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091002:":{"text":"네, 고귀하신 부인. 이런 더러운 꼴을 보여 드려... 정말 죄송합니다.","source_cn":"是，尊贵的女士。很抱歉……让这坨垃圾污染了您的眼睛","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61E7D9B75251B0B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091003:":{"text":"제가 바로 처리하겠습니다.","source_cn":"卑职立刻把他处理掉","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22B2E202254841DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091004:":{"text":"아니, 아니요. 부탁이니 저에게 기회를 주세요. 제가 반드시...","source_cn":"不、不，求求您，再给我个机会，我一定、一定会——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x419FB3581D16E1BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091005:":{"text":"하하하, 기회요?","source_cn":"呵呵呵，机会吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF32226295D4A9E29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091006:":{"text":"네, 네! 제가... 절, 절대로 실망시키지 않겠습니다! 꼭!","source_cn":"是、是！我……卑职……小的，小的一定不会让您失望，一定！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFE3F8350F2FB9C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091007:":{"text":"하하하하, 그럼 어디 한 번 지켜보죠.","source_cn":"呵呵呵呵呵，既然如此，就试试看吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87AA57FF45A1277B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091008:":{"text":"부인... 저 놈이 전부 망쳐버렸는데, 관용을 베푸시다니요...","source_cn":"女士……那家伙可是搞砸了，你竟如此宽容……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB52615FA44F091C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091009:":{"text":"어쨌든 그는 우리가 “그걸” 불러내는 데 도움을 줬으니, 완전히 망친 건 아니지.","source_cn":"毕竟他也帮我们唤出了“那东西”，也不算完全搞砸了嘛","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE508CAE059495E7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091010:":{"text":"한 번의 기회 정도는 작은 보상으로 줄 수도 있으니.","source_cn":"一次机会，就当做小小的奖励吧","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82015629AC5BA813","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"subtitle:2:1011091011:":{"text":"하지만 진짜 중요한 실험은 <style=\"highlight\">땅거미 숲</style>에 있으니... 이번엔 절대 착오가 생겨선 안 됩니다.","source_cn":"不过，真正要紧的，还在<style=\"highlight\">薄暮丛林</style>那边——可不要出岔子了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4BB667B50277FAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:黑屏":{"text":"블랙 스크린","source":"黑屏","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑金女士":{"text":"블랙골드 여사","source":"黑金女士","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑金男掮客":{"text":"블랙골드 브로커","source":"黑金男掮客","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:弗朗茨":{"text":"로드 프란츠","source":"弗朗茨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":4}}